---
title: Media frames
description: A picture or a clip in the middle of a shot — the system’s radius, one hairline, the one shadow, and an indicator if it needs one. Nothing else; the picture is the point.
eyebrow: Content creation · Elements
source: src/studio/media.css
---
<p><code>im-studio-media</code> is a <code>figure</code> with the picture inside. Its width is a share of the frame (<code>--im-studio-media-w</code>, 60%) and its ratio is the picture’s (<code>--im-studio-media-ratio</code>, 16:9). Everything else is a modifier: the edge, the shape, the mark on it.</p>

