<h2>As a layer</h2>
<p>A media frame is a layer like anything else; <code>data-in="curtain"</code> is the one that suits a picture best — a panel of the accent crosses and leaves it behind.</p>
{{#example}}
<div class="frame-preview" data-replay><div class="im-studio im-center-grid" style="--im-studio-w: 960; --im-studio-h: 540"><span class="im-studio-ground im-studio-ground-dots"></span><figure class="im-studio-media im-studio-media-shadow im-studio-layer" data-in="curtain" style="--im-studio-media-w: 56%"><img src="{{demo.shots.[5]}}" alt=""></figure></div></div>
{{/example}}
